 "Fire Response: Office Safety Training", "keywords": ["fire", "safety", "training", "education", "simulation"], "long_description": "**A fire breaks out at a desk in your office. Do you reach for water or CO2?**\n\n\n# **What you will learn**\n\n* How to recognise types of fire extinguishers and what they are built for\n* Which extinguishers are safe on energised electrical equipment, and which put you at risk of electrocution\n* The PASS technique: Pull, Aim, Squeeze, Sweep\n* How to approach, assess and put out a fire safely in a confined workspace\n\n\n# **Two modules**\n\n**Learning**\n\nA guided walkthrough. Prompts take you through extinguisher selection and correct technique step by step, with feedback the moment you go wrong.\n\n**Assessment**\n\nNo prompts, no hints. You face the scenario alone and are scored on whether you chose correctly and applied the technique properly.\n\n\n# **Why in VR**\n\nNobody learns fire response from a slide deck. Performing the actions yourself - lifting the right unit, pulling the pin, sweeping the base of the flames - builds the muscle memory that matters when it is real. And you can get it wrong safely, as many times as you need.\n\nFire classification and extinguisher guidance follow **EN 2 (Europe)**.\n\nBuilt by **Vector Reality**, a custom immersive training studio working with manufacturers across automotive, pharmaceutical and heavy industry.\n", "short_description": "A fire breaks out at a desk in your office. Do you reach for water or CO2?\n\nThis hands-on training experience teaches workplace fire response, built\naround the case most people get wrong: a fire involving live electrical\nequipment. Learn to identify extinguisher types, pick the right one, and\napply the PASS technique under pressure.\n\nTwo modules - a guided Learning mode that walks you through every step, and an Assessment mode that scores you with no help at all."}]}, "developer_name": "Vector Reality", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://w